+# Invoice review service
+
+## Purpose
+
+This project reviews invoice line items and returns findings to a human finance operator.
+
+## Current behavior
+
+The current source detects duplicate invoice references. It returns each duplicated reference once, sorted in ascending order.
+
+The README also identifies arithmetic mismatch review as part of the project scope, but the current source does not establish an implementation for that behavior.
+
+## Boundary
+
+This project does not authorize or send payments.
